    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "6886e864-1bb1-3ad0-af8c-b8287c0e46a6",
                "word": "Dalek",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c248f34c-f347-43e2-b280-f4a23ea8f77a",
                        "entry_id": "6886e864-1bb1-3ad0-af8c-b8287c0e46a6",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Daleks"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "50f5eba1-8e81-3eb6-b6b0-c8d3eceab7b5",
                        "entry_id": "6886e864-1bb1-3ad0-af8c-b8287c0e46a6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A member of a species of extraterrestrial cyborg mutants who appear in the television programme Doctor Who and are known for travelling in metallic shells, having monotone, mechanically distorted voices, repeating a limited number of phrases, and their fanatical obsession with exterminating other, non-Dalek beings."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0269e95a-7d24-4a7f-9d78-239bdf39eb4d",
                                "sense_id": "50f5eba1-8e81-3eb6-b6b0-c8d3eceab7b5",
                                "text": "'But Alydon,' I persisted, 'the Daleks aren't human beings. They're just evil, half creatures, half machines, determined to destroy you.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6372af0-2d1b-49cb-811f-1915bbc64f1c",
                                "sense_id": "50f5eba1-8e81-3eb6-b6b0-c8d3eceab7b5",
                                "text": "[…] what kind of courage it must have taken for Hawkins, an actor renowned for the quality of his voice, to go back onto the set to deliver lines in that oesophageal monotone, what he called his \"Dalek voice\"."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af513a21-f23f-4e7f-b1d5-78921d59ed17",
                                "sense_id": "50f5eba1-8e81-3eb6-b6b0-c8d3eceab7b5",
                                "text": "This synthesizer is by far the best I have heard, because it varies the intonation, and does not speak like a Dalek."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2c467ec-6d54-4465-97b1-510c4998e7dc",
                                "sense_id": "50f5eba1-8e81-3eb6-b6b0-c8d3eceab7b5",
                                "text": "My voice still insisted on disappearing into my shoes every time it happened so that I sounded like a Dalek, but with a bit of experience behind me I felt marginally more confident."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0252c4e4-0b13-4dfa-bad3-41e5f576fafe",
                                "sense_id": "50f5eba1-8e81-3eb6-b6b0-c8d3eceab7b5",
                                "text": "One man was skiting around on a big, wheeled camera like a Dalek, dodging the scurrying assistants and clipboard-wielders, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be7f80cf-f828-4520-91b8-92993d8eb2fe",
                                "sense_id": "50f5eba1-8e81-3eb6-b6b0-c8d3eceab7b5",
                                "text": "Then the Dalek turned and picked off the other passengers one by one. It screamed... 'Exterminate! Exterminate! Exterminate!'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c444d474-e743-4a17-b80a-47fa686c0379",
                                "sense_id": "50f5eba1-8e81-3eb6-b6b0-c8d3eceab7b5",
                                "text": "Gordon Brown sounds like a Dalek with about three stock phrases... Remember, Daleks always want world domination but they always lose."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e09d95f0-8ba1-40b8-8a8b-124cbca61c6a",
                                "sense_id": "50f5eba1-8e81-3eb6-b6b0-c8d3eceab7b5",
                                "text": "And Peter was so focused too: like a Dalek in a track suit."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "495a81d8-9043-3c59-9b3e-c5a3f03c753b",
                        "entry_id": "6886e864-1bb1-3ad0-af8c-b8287c0e46a6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who is dogmatic, unfeeling and determined."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "662bf6f7-9214-407e-b93e-a25506a4fbc7",
                                "sense_id": "495a81d8-9043-3c59-9b3e-c5a3f03c753b",
                                "text": "In a remarkable speech in 2006, Ray criticised 'factional Daleks' and 'the Stasi element' — apparatchiks 'highly professional and proficient but with no Labor soul'."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "acbbbf0c-6029-44c4-ba87-a020e5a5f8c1",
                                "sense_id": "495a81d8-9043-3c59-9b3e-c5a3f03c753b",
                                "text": "In an article in The Times Lord Chalfont said: \"The programmed Daleks of the French military planners were evolving a plan which was really a carbon copy of the British plan.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f62a565c-e073-4a95-82a2-96e49127d0e5",
                                "sense_id": "495a81d8-9043-3c59-9b3e-c5a3f03c753b",
                                "text": "And rightly so, if only out of respect for the numerous idiosyncrasies left out of any generalized model of behaviour and, if only out of sheer personal honesty in admitting that individuals are never like the streamlined daleks of psychometric regressions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b9ad5e2-8db9-4a30-9f7e-fe4c10948bd4",
                                "sense_id": "495a81d8-9043-3c59-9b3e-c5a3f03c753b",
                                "text": "The following year Dennis Potter, by then dying of a cancer tumour he had named 'Rupert Murdoch', attacked [John] Birt as 'a croak-voiced Dalek' dressed in an Armani suit."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
